       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-PRIVACY-FEDERATED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PRIVACY-FEDERATED-PROOFS.
           05  WS-DP-SGD-RENYI-BOUND-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FEDERATED-AVERAGING-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPARSETENSOR-COO-CSR-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TPU-EMBEDDING-PAGING-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SECP256K1-FED-CONSENSUS  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-FEDERATED-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-FEDERATED-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-FEDERATED-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PRIVACY-AND-FEDAVG.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SPARSE-AND-EMBEDDINGS.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-CONSENSUS.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-FEDERATED-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PRIVACY-AND-FEDAVG.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DP-SGD-RENYI-BOUND-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FEDERATED-AVERAGING-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SPARSE-AND-EMBEDDINGS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPARSETENSOR-COO-CSR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TPU-EMBEDDING-PAGING-OK.
       3000-EVALUATE-CONSENSUS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SECP256K1-FED-CONSENSUS.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-FEDERATED-PROOFS.
           IF WS-DP-SGD-RENYI-BOUND-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FEDERATED-AVERAGING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPARSETENSOR-COO-CSR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TPU-EMBEDDING-PAGING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SECP256K1-FED-CONSENSUS = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-FEDERATED-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-FEDERATED-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-FEDERATED-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-FEDERATED-CODE.
